From 8118f30b1cd287a28be580c910f2336b2ee4a989 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dev <dev@local>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 04:56:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] lsfg-vk step 2c: port alpha, beta, gamma and delta passes

Mechanical port of Eden's four processing stages to vulkan-hpp (Device -> Instance, raw Vk*
handles -> vk::*, MemoryAllocator argument dropped since LsfgImage allocates through VMA).
Descriptor sets are allocated from the pool without keeping an owner (freed with the pool).
Adds a vector-of-layouts overload of AllocateLsfgDescriptorSets.

NOT COMPILED (see 2a). Not run through clang-format (not available in this environment).
